---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---
<BaseLayout
  title="Sporty — Privacy (Draft)"
  description="Draft privacy policy for Sporty."
>
  <main class="policy-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy (Draft)</h1>
    <p>Sporty processes your measurements to generate sport recommendations. We store your data only when you create an account and explicitly consent to retention.</p>

    <section class="policy-callout">
      <strong>Key points</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Inputs collected: body measurements, optional preferences, injury notes, past sports, and goals.</li>
        <li>Storage: Supabase Postgres; data is kept only after you grant consent. You can revoke consent anytime from your profile.</li>
        <li>Account deletion: you can permanently delete your account from Dashboard → Account &amp; Data.</li>
        <li>Access: limited to you (and verified guardians for child data in future phases). Row-Level Security protects every table.</li>
        <li>Sharing: no data sales. Aggregated, anonymized insights may be published.</li>
        <li>Deletion: revoke consent to erase identifiable sport data while keeping account access, or delete account to remove account access and identifiable profile data.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="policy-callout">
      <strong>Retention matrix (launch default)</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Profile + analysis data (measurements, submissions, recommendations, child-linked runs): deleted when consent is revoked or account is deleted.</li>
        <li>Anonymous learning events: retained in de-identified form for model improvement.</li>
        <li>Billing ledger: minimal pseudonymous purchase/accounting fields retained for up to 10 years for legal obligations.</li>
        <li>Deletion job logs: retained up to 24 months for operational audit and incident follow-up.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <p>This document is an interim summary while we prepare the lawyer-reviewed policy for launch. Contact us with any questions or concerns.</p>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div>
        <strong>Questions?</strong>
        <p class="lead-copy">Reach us at hello@sporty.test for privacy or data requests.</p>
      </div>
      <small>© <span id="year">2025</span> Sporty</small>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <Fragment slot="scripts">
    <script>
      const yearEl = document.getElementById('year');
    if (yearEl) {
      yearEl.textContent = String(new Date().getFullYear());
    }
    </script>
  </Fragment>
</BaseLayout>
